Comment:
 This package is built by the project itself from its release files. Besides
 PS VulkanPlay's own code it carries libraries of others: FFmpeg (LGPL 2.1 or
 later), Opus (BSD 3-Clause), OpenSSL (Apache 2.0) and SDL 3 (zlib) linked into
 the stream program, and the .NET runtime, Avalonia, SkiaSharp and HarfBuzzSharp
 (MIT) with the app. THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md beside this file lists them, and
 LIBRARIES.txt the versions and the addresses of their source archives.

